      <p class="sub">Your card wasn't charged. Your seat request is held open for a little while if you'd like to finish paying.</p>
      <a class="primary" id="retryLink" href="#" style="display:block; background:var(--teal-fill); color:var(--on-teal); border-radius:12px; padding:15px; font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:12px;">Finish booking</a>
